	(text "SPI ROUTING: the motor and dribbler buses are 50 ohm lines, on L1 over the L2 GND plane and\non L4 / L6 over the L5 GND plane (DESIGN_NOTES section 2). R15/R16, R67/R68 and R70/R71 are\nsource damping at the MCU; verify every multidrop endpoint. ESD arrays sit at the connectors\n(flow-through, GND pads straight to vias).\nF3 -> J11, F4 -> J12: independent PTC output rails. J10 carries no power:\nthe kicker board is supplied by the powerboard.\n0.75 A PTCs: each holds 0.55 A at 50C; NOT a combined available budget.\nShared U8/source limits still apply; fault selectivity is not guaranteed.\nShared I2C signals remain vulnerable to any device holding a bus line low."
		(at 241.3 303.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "78e8e646-e04e-4587-b3a4-d1abd13f37d4")
	)
	(text "CS PULL-UPS / PULL-DOWNS"
		(at 318.77 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "856ce745-0560-4266-8d77-1b29d3edd789")
	)
	(text "MOTOR MODULES J4-J8"
		(at 101.6 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8adaeaaa-6b3c-4b21-9e2a-13e700eef483")
	)
	(text "I2C CONNECTORS: J10 KICKER (SIGNALS ONLY), J11/J12 FED BY F3/F4"
		(at 158.75 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c00c53a1-9335-4599-8c0e-8e48f8ec1908")
	)
	(text "SCOPE TEST POINTS"
		(at 300.99 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "df71773f-fd1d-4480-8778-aef65aebde23")
	)
	(text "RADIO LINK J9 (SAMTEC LSHM MEZZANINE)"
		(at 151.13 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c67e2c3b-d16c-4f7c-8309-69103ddee361")
	)
	(text "J9 = 30x40 radio J2 (Inboard / Overhang), LSHM-110-02.5 on both (5mm stack).\nEven row: 2 CS, 4 MOSI, 8 SCK, 10 HANDSHAKE, 12 DATA_READY, 16 MISO, 20 RST;\n6/14/18 GND. Odd row: 1-13 GND, 15/17/19 +3V3. SH to GND.\nFace to face, pin p here mates radio pin p+1 (odd p) or p-1 (even p).\nThe radio sits over the MCU on the M2 standoffs HR1/HR2.\nR31 100k / R32 10k hold HANDSHAKE/DATA_READY low with the radio absent or in reset.\nReset is open-drain into the radio's 10k/1uF EN network (DESIGN_NOTES §11)."
		(at 151.13 302.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "824c88a2-8678-4204-b0fd-0c01bce1c930")
	)
	(text "OLED J13 (SSD1306)"
		(at 238.76 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
