		(property "Description" "10k DATA_READY pull-down (MCU PB6): holds the line low while the radio is unplugged or in reset; the radio boards add no pull on this line (radio GPIO0 = DATA_READY). Even against a ~45k internal pull-up on the radio pin, 10k gives about 0.6V, below the STM32 input-low limit of 0.4VDD-0.1 = 1.22V (DS13313 Table 51). Check the ESP32-C5 GPIO0 reset state."
			(at 345.44 91.44 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
