		(property "Description" "Board-to-board link to the 30x40 radio board J2 (Inboard and Overhang variants). Samtec Razor Beam LSHM, 0.5mm, 20 pins, shielded, hermaphroditic: the same part on both boards, 5mm mated stack. Pin p here mates radio pin p+1 (odd) or p-1 (even). Shield pins paste-in-hole (2.00mm stencil apertures). The radio sits over the MCU on two M2 standoffs HR1/HR2 (DESIGN_NOTES §11)."
